 * Safe, minimal Markdown renderer for notes (SCN-025).
 * Escapes all HTML first, then applies a small subset:
 *   # / ## / ###, **bold**, *italic*, `code`, ```code blocks```,
 *   - / * bullet lists, 1. numbered lists, > blockquotes,
 *   [text](http(s)://url) links.
